      "value": "Oke, found VR Chat has alternative move option in the menu. Disable it and you have no jump line and your touch button will work as normal movement control.\n\nSo joystick is not really needed. But it's still slight better than touchbutton, because touchbutton has already another function for hands / eyes / special animations. Seperate both makes it more easier, but i understand Oculus/Vive has no joystick.",
